      "text": "Richard Willst\u00e4tter and Arthur Stoll supported a model in which carbon dioxide is split to release its oxygen.",
      "label": "p1",
      "factual": true,
      "role": "claim",
      "pos": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "a1",
      "text": "Cornelis van Niel studied photosynthetic sulfur bacteria in the 1930s.",
      "label": "p2",
      "factual": true,
      "role": "claim",
      "pos": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "a2",
      "text": "Van Niel based his hydrogen-donor model primarily on studies of cyanobacteria.",
      "label": "p3",
      "factual": false,
