      "text": "The oxygen evolved in the 1941 experiment did not match the isotopic composition of the water supplied.",
      "label": "p10",
      "factual": true,
      "role": "claim",
      "pos": 10,
      "factual_note": "exhaustive_pair: exactly one of this pair is false"
    },
    {
      "id": "a10",
      "text": "Oxygen atoms exchanged between water and carbon dioxide in the algal suspensions.",
      "label": "p11",
      "factual": true,
      "role": "claim",
      "pos": 11
    },
    {
      "id": "a11",
      "text": "Oxygen atoms exchanged between water and bicarbonate in the algal suspensions.",
